0000:                   * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   * NC - network terminal / netcat style client for OS-9 Net
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Usage: nc <port-device> [host:port]
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   nc /n2 www.example.org:80    dial through the Hayes style modem on /n2
0000:                   *                                (-net 2=modem on the simulator) and relay
0000:                   *                                keyboard and screen to the TCP connection
0000:                   *   nc /n3                       just relay to the line (listen/tcp ports)
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Keyboard CR is sent as CR LF; LF from the network is shown as CR LF.
0000:                   * Press ^C (or ^\) to disconnect.  The hang up is done by closing
0000:                   * the path (the NPty driver drops DTR when the last path is closed).
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Part of the MC6809/OS-9 simulator (see README / docs/OS9NET.md).
0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   
0000:                            nam   NC
0000:                            ttl   Network terminal client
0000:                   
0000:                            ifp1
0000:                            use   defsfile
0000:                            endc
0000:                   
0011:                   tylg     set   Prgrm+Objct
0081:                   atrv     set   ReEnt+rev
0001:                   rev      set   $01
0001:                   edition  set   1
0000:                   
